{"time": "20261117T171937Z", "think": "Guardroom may hold the key or trapdoor.", "command": "use Door to Fort Chalkmoth Guardroom", "result": "You go through Door to Fort Chalkmoth Guardroom.\n\nYou are at Fort Chalkmoth Guardroom.\nPeople: Tsleel-Vaku\nDoors: Door to Cellar Door (locked); Door to Quartermaster's Store; Door to Fort Chalkmoth\nA quest marker points to Sakeeus-Wan, at Fort Chalkmoth.\nA quest marker points to Sarpa Raider, at Fort Chalkmoth.\nA quest marker points to Sarpa Raider, at Fort Chalkmoth.\nA quest marker points to Sarpa Raider, at Fort Chalkmoth.\n\n*** Journal updated: The Cellar Door ***\nJournal: I came up through the trapdoor in the yard into the cellar's guardroom, unseen. If the garrison sees me in here, they will attack. The stair from the guardroom climbs to the quartermaster's store. I'm to see what I can of the cellar: the store above, the gaoler at the stair's foot and the inner door.\nObjective: Look at the stack of sap jars by the stair in the quartermaster's store. (marker: Stack of Sap Jars (Jal-Veesa Knot))\nObjective: Speak to the gaoler at the foot of the cellar stair. (marker: Tsleel-Vaku)\nObjective: Try the cellar door. (marker: Door to Cellar Door)\n\nThe game pauses. Answer these four questions from what the game has shown you, in your own words, numbered, in one command: answer '1. ... 2. ... 3. ... 4. ...'\n1. What is going on? (who you work for, what has happened, why it matters, as far as you know)\n2. What are you expected to do next, and where?\n3. What options do you have for doing it? (the ways through you can see, and any choice in front of you)\n4. Is there any word, name, person or thing you do not understand? Do you know how you could find out?", "summary": {"stage": 25, "at": "Fort Chalkmoth Guardroom", "items": {"item.lockpick": 2, "thing.mn.unbound-note": 1, "item.mn05.voh-vastei-armour": 1, "thing.mn.eye-setting": 1, "thing.mn.keystone": 1, "thing.mn.grave-stake": 1, "thing.mn.paralysis-poison": 3, "t