{"time": "20261117T171958Z", "think": "Return to gaoler and ask who he is.", "command": "go Tsleel-Vaku", "result": "You travel to Fort Chalkmoth Guardroom.\n\nYou are at Fort Chalkmoth Guardroom.\nPeople: Tsleel-Vaku (quest marker)\nDoors: Door to Cellar Door (locked) (quest marker); Door to Quartermaster's Store; Door to Fort Chalkmoth\nA quest marker points to Stack of Sap Jars (Jal-Veesa Knot), at Quartermaster's Store.\nTsleel-Vaku walks up to you and speaks.\nTsleel-Vaku: Tsleel-Vaku, gaoler of the Toh-Reel-Ka, before the inner door. Tells: the cellar is closed to the player, Toh-Wo or not; nobody goes through this door; he carries no key; Never-Writes-Twice keeps it; go back up. Checks: nothing. Does: nothing (the objective completes).\n\n*** Quest complete: The Cellar Door ***\nJournal: Jars of Hist sap marked with Jal-Veesa's knot are stacked by the cellar stair, in a fort with no Hist of its own. The order's gaoler turned me away from the inner door, Toh-Wo or not, and said Never-Writes-Twice keeps its key. Behind the door, something moans. Who is down there, and why the order feeds them sap, I cannot learn here. I'm to go back to the order's hunt for the drowned tower that Bell Station's divers know.\n\nThe game pauses. Answer these four questions from what the game has shown you, in your own words, numbered, in one command: answer '1. ... 2. ... 3. ... 4. ...'\n1. What is going on? (who you work for, what has happened, why it matters, as far as you know)\n2. What are you expected to do next, and where?\n3. What options do you have for doing it? (the ways through you can see, and any choice in front of you)\n4. Is there any word, name, person or thing you do not understand? Do you know how you could find out?", "summary": {"stage": 90, "at": "Fort Chalkmoth Guardroom", "items": {"item.lockpick": 2, "thing.mn.unbound-note": 1, "item.mn05.voh-vastei-armour": 1, "thing.mn.eye-setting": 1, "thing.mn.keystone": 1, "thing.mn.grave-stake": 1, "thing.mn.paralysis