{"time": "20261117T172001Z", "think": "Honest summary.", "command": "answer 1. The quest ended. In the fort with no Hist of its own there are jars of Hist sap with Jal-Veesa's knot by the cellar stair, and something moans behind the inner door. The gaoler Tsleel-Vaku says the door is closed to all and that Never-Writes-Twice keeps the key, which fits my suspicion of her. 2. Go back to the hunt: Bell Station, by boat from Lilmoth, for the divers who know which drowned tower is marked. 3. Go to Bell Station; or confront Never-Writes-Twice in Helstrom about the key. 4. I do not know who is moaning in the cellar or why the order feeds them sap; I might learn from Never-Writes-Twice or Jal-Veesa.", "result": "Noted.\n\nThe quest is over. Write your notes: what you now know and have, as you would tell a friend picking up your save. Give them in one command: answer '...'", "summary": {"stage": 90, "at": "Fort Chalkmoth Guardroom", "items": {"item.lockpick": 2, "thing.mn.unbound-note": 1, "item.mn05.voh-vastei-armour": 1, "thing.mn.eye-setting": 1, "thing.mn.keystone": 1, "thing.mn.grave-stake": 1, "thing.mn.paralysis-poison": 3, "thing.mn.bronze-disc": 1, "thing.mn.parchment-map": 1, "thing.mn10.rapier": 1}, "gold": 1050, "flags": {"flag.mn03.truth": true, "flag.mn06.note-read": true, "flag.mn06.done": true, "flag.main.seal-question": true, "flag.main.rank-toh-wo": true, "flag.mn11.rubbing-read": true, "flag.mn11.done": true, "flag.mn12.trapdoor": true, "flag.mn12.door-tried": true, "flag.mn12.jars-seen": true, "flag.mn12.cellar-seen": true}, "dead": ["npc.mn.hums-the-long-note"], "heard": ["topic.mn01-name", "topic.mn01-trade-warrior", "topic.mn01-dralin-free", "topic.mn02-give-moss", "topic.mn02-vosh-work", "topic.mn03-task", "topic.mn03-drink", "topic.mn03-tell-hide", "topic.mn03-heem-scar", "topic.mn03-truth", "topic.mn04-sesk-talk", "topic.mn04-vosh-report", "topic.mn04-ride", "topic.mn05-draught", "topic.mn05-give-jar", "topic.mn06-how-know", "topic.mn07-how-know", "