{"time": "20261117T172006Z", "think": "Final notes.", "command": "answer Notes: I entered Fort Chalkmoth unseen by the yard trapdoor (the captain Sakeeus-Wan only offered to open the keep if I killed three Sarpa raiders on the west approach; I did not). Below is a guardroom with gaoler Tsleel-Vaku; the inner cellar door is locked and he refuses persuasion and illusion, carries no key, and says Never-Writes-Twice keeps it. In the quartermaster store above are jars of Hist sap tied with Jal-Veesa's knot, in a fort with no Hist of its own. Something moans behind the door; I do not know who or why. Suspicious of Never-Writes-Twice, who dismissed the fort. Still to do: Bell Station (boat from Lilmoth) for the divers who know which drowned tower off Lilmoth is marked; Vanin the Collector is digging ahead. I carry 1050 gold, 2 lockpicks, the Unbound recipe note, Keystone, Paralysis Poison x3, Rapier and other items.", "result": "Thank you. Your notes are kept; the game is over. You can stop now.", "summary": {"stage": 90, "at": "Fort Chalkmoth Guardroom", "items": {"item.lockpick": 2, "thing.mn.unbound-note": 1, "item.mn05.voh-vastei-armour": 1, "thing.mn.eye-setting": 1, "thing.mn.keystone": 1, "thing.mn.grave-stake": 1, "thing.mn.paralysis-poison": 3, "thing.mn.bronze-disc": 1, "thing.mn.parchment-map": 1, "thing.mn10.rapier": 1}, "gold": 1050, "flags": {"flag.mn03.truth": true, "flag.mn06.note-read": true, "flag.mn06.done": true, "flag.main.seal-question": true, "flag.main.rank-toh-wo": true, "flag.mn11.rubbing-read": true, "flag.mn11.done": true, "flag.mn12.trapdoor": true, "flag.mn12.door-tried": true, "flag.mn12.jars-seen": true, "flag.mn12.cellar-seen": true}, "dead": ["npc.mn.hums-the-long-note"], "heard": ["topic.mn01-name", "topic.mn01-trade-warrior", "topic.mn01-dralin-free", "topic.mn02-give-moss", "topic.mn02-vosh-work", "topic.mn03-task", "topic.mn03-drink", "topic.mn03-tell-hide", "topic.mn03-heem-scar", "topic.mn03-truth", "topic.mn04-sesk-talk", "topic.mn0